{"4349020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Late Night Manifest", "steam_appid": 4349020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4861800, 5020680], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349020/extras/5faaf8ab0daa87e70e9064f056a9a093.avif?t=1788071251\" width=1024 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Late Night Manifest</strong> is a PSX-style  post-apocalyptic survival horror game with fixed third-person camera, focused on exploration, environmental storytelling, and puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin alone in your own home, with no clear answers. From there, you must explore the region by visiting key locations by car, unlocking doors, and navigating interconnected paths to reach critical destinations. Progress is driven by observation: examining environments, solving riddles, and overcoming obstacles that block your way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349020/extras/f4ee51311dcc2cb813814092a70651e6.poster.avif?t=1788071251\" width=700 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349020/extras/f4ee51311dcc2cb813814092a70651e6.webm?t=1788071251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349020/extras/f4ee51311dcc2cb813814092a70651e6.mp4?t=1788071251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game Mechanics</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A</strong> <strong>limited inventory system</strong> designed to reinforce tension and decision-making. Players can carry only a small number of items, forcing them to carefully choose what to bring before venturing into the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items can be stored in the inventory or <strong>held directly in Marco’s hands</strong>, affecting how you explore the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349020/extras/3a3757e0f5088900128546018a8d2d0a.avif?t=1788071251\" width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The destination is set, but the journey is yours to define. As you explore, you’ll discover weapons, tools, and key items that open new routes or allow you to survive increasingly tense encounters. Every unlocked door or hidden passage offers multiple ways to advance, letting you choose how to reach your goal rather than forcing a single path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349020/extras/14856d8b3eb390e6a4f7659d8849f056.avif?t=1788071251\" width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The apocalypse didn't happen by accident. Examine the environment and solve puzzles, riddles and unknowns to uncover the terrifying sequence of events that brought the world to its knees. Every note you find and every riddle you solve brings Marco one step closer to understanding the true nature of the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349020/extras/a0e07429c82e6db276cf785bf0238008.avif?t=1788071251\" width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loneliness is heavy, but you're not truly alone. Survivors are out there, waiting for you. To join them, you must overcome hardened paths and survive through pitch darkness. The meeting point is your lifeline. Don't let the shadows prevent you from reaching it. </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349020/extras/5faaf8ab0daa87e70e9064f056a9a093.avif?t=1788071251\" width=1024 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Late Night Manifest</strong> is a PSX-style  post-apocalyptic survival horror game with fixed third-person camera, focused on exploration, environmental storytelling, and puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You begin alone in your own home, with no clear answers. From there, you must explore the region by visiting key locations by car, unlocking doors, and navigating interconnected paths to reach critical destinations. Progress is driven by observation: examining environments, solving riddles, and overcoming obstacles that block your way forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349020/extras/f4ee51311dcc2cb813814092a70651e6.poster.avif?t=1788071251\" width=700 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349020/extras/f4ee51311dcc2cb813814092a70651e6.webm?t=1788071251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349020/extras/f4ee51311dcc2cb813814092a70651e6.mp4?t=1788071251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Game Mechanics</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A</strong> <strong>limited inventory system</strong> designed to reinforce tension and decision-making. Players can carry only a small number of items, forcing them to carefully choose what to bring before venturing into the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items can be stored in the inventory or <strong>held directly in Marco’s hands</strong>, affecting how you explore the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349020/extras/3a3757e0f5088900128546018a8d2d0a.avif?t=1788071251\" width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The destination is set, but the journey is yours to define. As you explore, you’ll discover weapons, tools, and key items that open new routes or allow you to survive increasingly tense encounters. Every unlocked door or hidden passage offers multiple ways to advance, letting you choose how to reach your goal rather than forcing a single path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349020/extras/14856d8b3eb390e6a4f7659d8849f056.avif?t=1788071251\" width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The apocalypse didn't happen by accident. Examine the environment and solve puzzles, riddles and unknowns to uncover the terrifying sequence of events that brought the world to its knees. Every note you find and every riddle you solve brings Marco one step closer to understanding the true nature of the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4349020/extras/a0e07429c82e6db276cf785bf0238008.avif?t=1788071251\" width=1024 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loneliness is heavy, but you're not truly alone. Survivors are out there, waiting for you. To join them, you must overcome hardened paths and survive through pitch darkness. The meeting point is your lifeline. Don't let the shadows prevent you from reaching it. </p>", "short_description": "As Marco, you wake up to a reality where the world shrou